*~
*.swp

# Local-only, never committed
.env
.env.*
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
nohup.out

# Downloaded model weights (~4 GB). setup.sh fetches them.
models/

# LoRA training checkpoints: 20 MB each, regenerated by a retrain.
# adapters/adapters.safetensors IS committed -- it is the shipped model and
# without it the assistant cannot run at all without retraining first.
adapters/[0-9]*_adapters.safetensors
adapters_eval/

# Recorded audio is never committed without explicit review. This must match
# where scripts/record_dataset.py actually writes (AUDIO_DIR), or real voice
# recordings land in a tracked directory. benchmarks/datasets/synth/ IS tracked:
# it is the say(1)-generated benchmark fixture set.
benchmarks/datasets/voice/
datasets/intent/asr_captured.jsonl

# The training split is 8.8 MB and is DERIVED -- `scripts/build_dataset.py` regenerates it
# byte-for-byte from the tracked seeds. valid/test.jsonl and seeds/ ARE tracked, so the
# published accuracy numbers stay reproducible from a clean clone without shipping the bulk.
datasets/intent/train.jsonl

# Generated
benchmarks/reports/
docs/figures/

# Private notes, not part of the project.
project-spec-invisible-voice-layer.md
